{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relax and step into the world of Hilda \u2013 a cow enjoying the beauty of picturesque landscapes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83c\udfb5 Listen \ud83c\udfb5</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in the sounds of <i>moo</i>-sic or let the gentle breeze lull you into calm.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83c\udf3f Admire \ud83c\udf3f</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A vast meadow at any time of day \u2013 glowing with light in the daytime, or under the starry sky at night.<br>For a special atmosphere, you can apply one of the filters:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CRT</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vintage Camera</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tilt-Shift</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u23f0 Additionally \u23f0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set an alarm, choose the time, and focus on what you\u2019ve planned \u2013 Hilda will take care of the rest.</p>","achievements":{"total":0},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4037960?t=1768599733","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4037960/96131bb44043d424892454b150f6ef1bc3fd9be7/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768599733","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4037960/f7b23629abb2bb67013e7d67a4d8c77849978ad3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768599733","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4037960/f7b23629abb2bb67013e7d67a4d8c77849978ad3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768599733","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],